      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Could you expand a bit more on the specific chemical mechanisms? Like, what's actually happening at the root interface when the pH drops too low and the iron becomes less soluble? I want to make sure the report explains why the uptake actually stops or slows down from a physiological standpoint.",
